From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mscoree: Start Mono's soft debugger agent when the user asks for it (6074)

WINE_MONO_DEBUGGER_AGENT, set by the user, gives the agent's options
(transport=dt_socket,address=127.0.0.1:PORT,...): mono_jit_parse_options
and mono_debug_init before the runtime starts, so debuggers that speak
Mono's soft debugger protocol can attach. Only loopback addresses are
taken; a loopback port is reachable by every local user, so this is a
developer's switch, never set by the system.
---
